# .editorconfig says end_of_line = lf, and this is what makes that true of the checkout as well as
# of the editor. Without it a clone on Windows arrives with CRLF, which fails
# `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` and leaves the shell scripts unable to run under bash.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
